  "title": "Quintessential Springy Irish Mung Bean Sprouts Curry",
  "description": "A jammy, springy, indulgent Irish dish featuring mung bean sprouts, this curry is a perfect blend of flavors and textures. It is made with a mother sauce base and cooked in a tandoor clay pot.",
