  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the tandoor clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and saute for another minute.",
    "Add the curry powder and saute for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the mung bean sprouts and saute for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the tomato puree, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the coconut milk and stir well to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for another 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with fresh herbs."
